                                "sense_id": "8018be7c-f689-3aa4-9fdb-852718aa4893",
                                "text": "He could sing you into tears, and dance you into love, and talk you into wonder; when he drew, you begged for his portrait by himself, and when he wrote, you solicited his autograph. Mr. Philip Withers had taken his moustache to foreign parts, and done the Continent sophisticatedly."
