                                "sense_id": "8018be7c-f689-3aa4-9fdb-852718aa4893",
                                "text": "There stood old Mandy McGovern, her long brown rifle half raised, her finger lying sophisticatedly along the trigger guard, that she might not touch the hair trigger."
                            },
