                                "sense_id": "8018be7c-f689-3aa4-9fdb-852718aa4893",
                                "text": "On their third album, Amorica (American), they stretch nicely beyond their Faces evocations, resulting in a pleasantly soulful, groovy, and sophisticatedly accurate recollection of a previous decade."
